From: andesk <build@andesk.local>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:09:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] patches: deployment folder, and the dependency build scripts
 pnpm 10+ blocks

Two unrelated additions, both needed to build and run this on a current machine.

server-dist/{start.bat,server.yaml} is the hand-written Windows deployment: a
launcher that syncs the DB schema, creates the admin account, then starts the
server, plus the config it reads. The Go server resolves server.yaml, ./server.db
and ./dist relative to its working directory (backend/config/config.go:143),
which is why the launcher cd's to its own folder first. The binary and the
frontend build are not committed; build.py produces them.

NOTE: server.yaml carries a signKey generated for local testing. Replace it
before any real deployment.

soybean-admin/pnpm-workspace.yaml gains allowBuilds. pnpm 10 and later do not run
a dependency's install scripts unless the project allows them, and four of
soybean-admin's dependencies need theirs: esbuild and vue-demi fetch/select
platform binaries in postinstall (without which vite build cannot run at all),
while es5-ext and simple-git-hooks are harmless either way. Generated with
pnpm approve-builds --all. Without this a clean
"pnpm install --frozen-lockfile" aborts with ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS.
---
 server-dist/.gitignore            |  8 +++++
 server-dist/server.yaml           | 52 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 server-dist/start.bat             | 36 +++++++++++++++++++++
 soybean-admin/pnpm-workspace.yaml |  5 +++
 4 files changed, 101 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 server-dist/.gitignore
 create mode 100644 server-dist/server.yaml
 create mode 100644 server-dist/start.bat

diff --git a/server-dist/.gitignore b/server-dist/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c0bd3a7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/server-dist/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Build outputs and runtime state, produced by build.py and by running the
+# server. Only the hand-written deployment files are tracked.
+rustdesk-api-server-pro.exe
+dist/
+data/
+server.db
+server.db-shm
+server.db-wal
